From edc159b82042500751c34a477547cb19ef1a97cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:38:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(controllers): preserve ordered material assignments

Retain every material declaration, including repeated bone patterns, in an immutable list. A map loses earlier expressions and can preserve the wrong override position. Keep parsing separate from evaluation so consumers can apply every expression in order.

CubeConverter PR #3 supplies the lighting, UV animation, legacy controller, visibility and owner setup APIs. Retain only the unmerged ordered material behavior over that upstream implementation.

BREAKING CHANGE: Replace materialsMap() with materialAssignments() and pass MaterialAssignment lists to BedrockRenderController constructors.
