 .../controller/BedrockControllerParser.java   | 13 +++++------
 .../BedrockAttachableRenderingTest.java       |  9 ++++----
 .../BedrockControllerLightingTest.java        | 17 +++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 39 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

